                        <content styleCode="bold">Inactive ingredients</content>
                     </content> anhydrous citric acid, flavor, glycerin, hydroxyethyl cellulose, microcrystalline cellulose and carboxymethylcellulose sodium, propylparaben, purified water, sodium benzoate, sorbitol solution, sucralose, sucrose, xanthan gum
 </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260119"/>
